    <h2 class="ai-model-section">Access and pricing</h2>
    <p>Developers can use it on the API as <code>gpt-6.1-terra</code> [1][3]. In ChatGPT it is in Work and Codex for Plus, Pro, Business, Enterprise, and Edu users, not in Chat [4][5]. On Amazon Bedrock it is generally available per AWS [6]. The Bedrock price and regions are not in the sources on this page.</p>
    <div class="ai-model-table-wrap">
      <table class="ai-model-table">
